From e9909575a4b0586c216746cc4cd3b754af04052f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:34:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] FP0801: a shell member reached through a member
 declared outside core is reported

Coverage of a receiver is now decided where the shell type enters the chain,
not at its leftmost root: repo.Connection.Open() reports Open even though repo
is a typed core parameter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011nXBkinjHz24B8aadiHZjn
